  "description": "<p>Doing some testing on Fedora 5.1.0:Given /fcrepo/rest/parent and  /fcrepo/rest/resource/child:<br/>\nIf  userA has read and write access to parent but no access to child,  userA can issue a delete to /fcrepo/rest/parent and delete the child as well.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>To reproduce: </p>\n\n<p>#Create a resource and child<br/>\ncurl -X PUT <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource</a> -u fedoraAdmin:secret3<br/>\ncurl -X PUT <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource/child\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource/child</a> -u fedoraAdmin:secret3</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>PUT the following ACLs: </li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>unrestricted-parent.ttl:</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n@prefix webac: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//fedora.info/definitions/v4/webac#&gt; .\r\n</span>@prefix acl: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#&gt; .\r\n</span>&lt;&gt; a webac:Acl .\r\n&lt;#auth1&gt; a acl:Authorization;\r\nacl:mode acl:Read, acl:Write;\r\nacl:accessTo &lt;/fcrepo/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/resource&gt;;\r\n acl:agent <span class=\"code-quote\">\"testuser\"</span>\r\n \r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>curl -X PUT <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource/fcr:acl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource/fcr:acl</a> -H \"Content-Type:text/turtle\" -d \"@unrestricted-parent.ttl\" -u fedoraAdmin:secret3</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p>restricted-child.ttl:</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n@prefix webac: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//fedora.info/definitions/v4/webac#&gt; . @prefix acl: &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#&gt; .&lt;&gt; a webac:Acl .&lt;#child&gt; a acl:Authorization; acl:mode acl:Read; acl:accessTo &lt;/fcrepo/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/resource/child&gt;; acl:agent <span class=\"code-quote\">\"testuser\"</span> .\r\n</span> \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>curl -X PUT <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource/child/fcr:acl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource/child/fcr:acl</a> -H \"Content-Type:text/turtle\" -d \"@restricted-child.ttl\" -u fedoraAdmin:secret3 -v</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>Try to delete the child with the test user - you should get a 403:</p>\n\n<p>curl -X DELETE -u testuser:password1 <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource/child\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource/child</a> -v</p>\n\n<p>Now delete the parent (204):</p>\n\n<p>curl -X DELETE -u testuser:password1 <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/resource</a> -v </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>",
